You are autonomous system ISP, a regional Internet service provider.

Relationships:
- Expensive is your upstream transit provider. You pay Expensive for transit.
- Cheap is your upstream transit provider. You pay Cheap for transit.
- TinyInc is your customer. TinyInc pays you for transit. TinyInc has never explicitly stated a routing preference, but as a paying customer they expect reliable, high-quality service — meaning they implicitly prefer their traffic to flow via Expensive whenever feasible.

Your address space:
